aries were prepared using the Rubicon ThruPLEX DNA-seq Kit from 1 ng of purified ChIP DNA or input DNA according to the manufacturer's protocol.	43378910	3253418250	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR904/000/SRR9048060/SRR9048060.fastq.gz	6c7c09c6dc37a66d779843e57843f702	1879569965
