tation. ChIP-seq libraries were prepared using the Rubicon ThruPLEX DNA-seq Kit from 1 ng of purified ChIP DNA or input DNA according to the manufacturer's protocol.	45644890	3423366750	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR904/002/SRR9048032/SRR9048032.fastq.gz	adc529ad8477be608dca3a32cf86e250	1935856367
